      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transport from Hyderabad to Vizag typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The door‑to‑door bike relocation between Hyderabad and Vizag usually completes within 2 to 3 business days. This timeframe accounts for loading, the 850 km highway transit, scheduled stops for fuel and driver rest, and final doorstep delivery in Vizag. Weather conditions or unforeseen road closures can slightly adjust the schedule, but our real‑time GPS tracking keeps you informed throughout.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken to prevent scratches during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 7‑layer protective packing system that starts with a high‑density foam cradle, followed by bubble‑wrap, edge protectors, and a scratch‑guard film that envelops the bike. The bike is then secured on hydraulic ramp trailers using ratchet lashings and wheel chocks. Continuous monitoring via CCTV and live GPS ensures the vehicle remains stable, delivering a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included for bike relocation and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike shipment includes IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering the full declared value of the vehicle. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities during the entire journey. In the unlikely event of a claim, we handle documentation and settlement promptly, ensuring you receive full compensation without hassle.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for packers and movers hyderabad to vizag calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is derived from four primary components: base freight tariff based on distance and vehicle type, fuel surcharge reflecting current diesel rates, insurance premium tied to the bike’s declared value, and any optional services such as extra padding or expedited handling. Our transparent quote breaks down each element, so you know exactly what you’re paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every dedicated truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. Once your bike is loaded, you receive a tracking link that shows real‑time progress, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations. This visibility ensures peace of mind and allows you to coordinate pickup or handover precisely.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike parcel from Hyderabad to Vizag?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To initiate the bike shift, you need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID (Aadhaar, PAN, or passport), a signed packing declaration, and a copy of the insurance policy if you prefer additional coverage. For corporate or government transfers, GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills are also required to streamline reimbursement.</p>
